# Vibe12 workspace memory (curated bootstrap)

Short standing brief for agent wakes — not a transcript. Daily detail: `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`.

> Copy from `templates/` via `bin/vibe12_workspace_init.sh`. Fill in **your** site facts; do not commit this file.

## Stack (your deployment)

| Layer | Fact |
|-------|------|
| Edge gateway | _(IP, user, SSH)_ |
| Site / building | `site_id` / `building_id` from Ansible host_vars |
| Read driver | `vibe12-bacnet-read.service` · interval · samples/cycle |
| BACnet | bind address · router · target devices |
| MQTT | client name · topic prefix `vibe12` |
| Cloud | stack name · region · ingest rule |
| Dashboard | URL in `aws_cloud_pipeline/DEPLOYED.md` after deploy |

## Standing decisions

- One MQTT client on the gateway for BACnet + optional GPIO.
- Ingest writes `brick_timeseries_ref` on each sample.
- Cloud deploy from build machine with local `samconfig.toml` (gitignored).

## Smoke (expected healthy)

- `GET /api/commissioning/status/{site}/{building}` → `cloud_ingest_ok: true`
- `./scripts/validate_cloud_pipeline.sh` exits 0

## Open loops

- _(Agent promotes resolved items; human clears stale risks.)_

